        '****** (This code is proper) This part is required if the Gross Weight per piece has to be equal to that mentioned in Return Memo ******
        ''*** (Jen 2.13)
        'If wi_MainMetRow > 0 And GrdOrdRm.Rows - 1 > 0 Then
